        "value": "<p><strong>SAMPLE TYPE &ndash; PERIPHERAL BLOOD IN SODIUM HEPARIN</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Instrument &ndash; BD FACS LYRIC 3 Laser 10 Color</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Panel used &ndash; Acute Leukemia</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Clinical details&ndash; </strong>?AML &ndash; partly treated</p>\n<p><strong>CBC and P/S&ndash;</strong>Hb- 6.6 gm/dl; TLC- 19400/cumm;&nbsp; Plt count- 1.91lac/cumm</p>\n<p><strong>Morphology : </strong>Peripheral smears show ~18% blasts. DLC &ndash; Blasts; 18, My; 20, MMy; 11, N; 20, L; 22, M; 02, E; 01, B; 06. WBC series shows shift to left with myeloid bulge and basophilia.</p>\n<p><strong>Analysis</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Gating Strategy: CD45 vs SSC</strong></p>\n<p>-~15% of viable singlets gated in the blast window.</p>\n<p>These cells show moderate side scatter and dim CD45 expression.</p>\n<p><strong>Positive markers: Gated cells are positive for</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table class=\"MsoTableGrid cke_show_border\" style=\"height: 445.6px; width: 50%; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" data-cke-table-faked-selection-table=\"\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 55px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 32.409%; padding: 1px;\">\n<p><strong>Marker</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 60.5734%; padding: 1px;\">\n<p><strong>Intensity </strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 55px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 32.409%; padding: 1px;\">\n<p><strong>cyMPO</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 60.5734%; padding: 1px;\">\n<p><strong>Moderate</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 55px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 32.409%; padding: 1px;\">\n<p><strong>CD117</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 60.5734%; padding: 1px;\">\n<p><strong>Bright</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 55px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 32.409%; padding: 1px;\">\n<p><strong>CD13</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 60.5734%; padding: 1px;\">\n<p><strong>Bright</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 55px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 32.409%; padding: 1px;\">\n<p><strong>CD33</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 60.5734%; padding: 1px;\">\n<p><strong>Dim &ndash; Moderate</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 55px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 32.409%; padding: 1px;\">\n<p><strong>CD34</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 60.5734%; padding: 1px;\">\n<p><strong>Bright</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 55px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 32.409%; padding: 1px;\">\n<p><strong>HLA DR</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 60.5734%; padding: 1px;\">\n<p><strong>Bright</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 60px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 32.409%; padding: 1px;\">\n<p><strong>CD7</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 60.5734%; padding: 1px;\">\n<p><strong>Partial</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>Negative markers</strong></p>\n<table class=\"MsoTableGrid cke_show_border\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 50%; border-spacing: 0px;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" data-cke-table-faked-selection-table=\"\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>CD64, CD14, CD15</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>CD19, cyCD79a,</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>cyCD3, sCD3, CD56</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
